    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "FY2025 10-K 对 Google Cloud 的收入来源披露，核心是通过 Google Cloud Platform 和 Google Workspace 提供服务，收入主要来自消费型费用和订阅，覆盖基础设施、平台、应用及其他云服务。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000103-d95e78b6",
            "quote": "Through our Google Cloud Platform and Google Workspace offerings"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000103-d95e78b6",
            "quote": "generates revenues primarily from consumption-based fees and subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000103-d95e78b6",
            "quote": "for infrastructure, platform, applications, and other cloud services"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "2026 Q2 10-Q 把 Google Cloud 的收入来源列得更细：除 Google Cloud Platform 和 Google Workspace 外，还单列了产品销售，且明确写明主要是 TPU systems 的销售，以及其他企业服务。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000127-96c0700f",
            "quote": "Google Cloud revenues consist of revenues from:"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000128-aa97da5a",
            "quote": "Google Cloud Platform primarily generates consumption-based fees and subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000129-d23aecf2",
            "quote": "Google Workspace includes subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000130-abd62671",
            "quote": "Product sales, primarily the sale of TPU systems"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000131-d9e74cdc",
            "quote": "Other enterprise services"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "两期文件中未变的是：Google Cloud Platform 仍以消费型费用和订阅为主，Google Workspace 仍是订阅型收入。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000018",
            "index_id": "didx-320f0efaace7b324",
            "block_id": "block-000103-d95e78b6",
